"P296993338" "Battle For Siren's Call"
// Script Variable BountyHunterGameInfoHero :
"P1940544352" "This is an APB from the SC Police Precint. Heroes are urgently needed. Arachnos is attacking locations in this zone. Here's what you need to do.<br><br>When attacks happen we will show them on your mini-map.<br><br>In the battle areas, protect Longbow agents and defeat Arachnos. If enough of our troops survive and enough Arachnos are defeated, we will win the battle. If the villains control Siren's Call, they will hijack the special equipment bound for the store here.  Without those goods, it will be forced to close its doors.<br><br>You also earn a bounty for winning battles and defeating player villains with an extra if you bring your Most Wanted to justice.  You can see the Chief at anytime to cash in your reward.<br><br>Remember, it's us against them - heroes vs. villains.  Work with your teammates and arrest those villains!"
// Script Variable BountyHunterGameInfoVillain :
"P2267090500" "It's time to make Siren's Call our turf -- and here's the plan.<br><br>Arachnos is launching attacks throughout the zone. As battles start we will show them on your mini-map. Go to these locations.<br><br>At a battle site, defeat Longbow and making sure the Arachnos troops survive to win the battle. If we win enough times, then we can control Siren's Call.<br><br>Lord Recluse has authorized us to sell any goods found - but only if we control Siren's Call. That's handled through a store on our base. He is also offering bounty for winning neighborhood battles and defeating any player heroes, including extra bounty if you bring down your named contract. Earn enough bounty and you can check back with the Arbiter to collect your reward.<br><br>Remember, it's us against them - villains vs. heroes. Lord Recluse says we work as a team - or else."
